{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57347","headline":"登天台 · 葛玄","name":"登天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高就山上山，山中白云闲。\n瀑布低头看，青天举手扳。\n石桥横海外，风笛落人间。\n不见红尘客，时时鹤往还。\n（见《四库珍本初集》本《天台集·拾遗》）（按：葛谛晋前神仙，见《太平广记》卷七十一引《神仙传》。\n此首五律显爲齐梁以後人依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"葛玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}